# Pyramid Level 3 - The Sanctum (biome: pyramid)
# Symbols: % = pyramid wall   . = stone floor   + = start
# Monster spawns: i = Isis   n = minotaur   d = dragon (the hidden one)
# THE RELIQUARY WALL: four alcoves cut into the north wall at the exact
# encounter-chest cells (9,3) (13,3) (17,3) (21,3) - clearing four Isis slides
# the dragon reliquaries open there (see map_configs clear_encounters). Four
# Isis stand on the dais line before them. The processional runs south to the
# start; three more Isis and the minotaurs hold it. WEST: the DRAGON VAULT -
# reinforced door, a skull mounted at the turn, then the steel door, then the
# dragon and its golden hoard. EAST: the stair chamber down to level 2.
